WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.369
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:04.370
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.672
And now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.440
President Biden has reportedly
been telling aides

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.109
in private
that he no longer recognizes

00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:12.345
the Republican party
and views them

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.613
as an existential threat
to democracy.

00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:18.618
Oh, good, you're all caught up.

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:21.320
This is like when you watch
three episodes of a show

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.422
and you have to wait for
your partner to watch them

00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:25.291
before you can move
to Episode 4.

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:28.027
"I hope I can
remember what's going on.

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:30.730
It's been like a year."

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.631
President Biden
spoke today in Buffalo

00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:35.501
and called on Congress
to pass new gun-control laws.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:38.972
Also today,
a tree fell in the forest.

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:44.744
In a new interview,
Dr. Anthony Fauci criticized

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:46.412
the Trump administration's
handling of

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:49.582
the coronavirus pandemic and
said it "wasn't optimal,"

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:51.084
which is kind of
like saying

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:54.754
the Hindenburg
experienced a flight delay.

00:00:57.923 --> 00:01:00.960
In a new interview,
Supreme Court justice designate

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.396
Ketanji Brown Jackson
said the reality show

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:04.864
"Survivor"
is the best show ever.

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.399
Well, at least you're prepared

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.968
for votes to not go your way.

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:12.838
Sweden announced yesterday
it will apply to join NATO.

00:01:12.838 --> 00:01:15.441
Wow! First Finland, now Sweden.

00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:18.378
It seems like every day,
we're learning about another

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:22.715
country we could have sworn
was already in NATO.

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.920
The CDC this week advised
domestic travelers

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.522
to get tested
for the coronavirus

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:31.690
no more than
three days before their trip.

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.093
Incidentally,
three days before the trip

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:38.731
is also when your dad thinks
you should get to the airport.

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:41.200
"'Cause there might be traffic!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:45.738
I'm not crazy.
There's been traffic before."

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:48.474
McDonald's announced yesterday
it would completely exit

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:51.110
the Russian market,
and that's not the only way

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:53.479
they're showing
their support for Ukraine.

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:55.515
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:03.523
Surprised. I don't know why
that one was the one.

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:09.896
Are you upset that, like --
that Grimace got painted?

00:02:11.063 --> 00:02:13.600
Do you guys know
he's supposed to be a taste bud?

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:17.503
I just found out.

00:02:17.503 --> 00:02:19.639
It's [bleep] disgusting,
but there you go.

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.711
I'm just thrown.

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:28.981
Police in Washington state
over the weekend said

00:02:28.981 --> 00:02:31.684
that they had obtained video
of an Arby's manager

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:34.686
urinating into the
restaurant's milkshake machine.

00:02:34.686 --> 00:02:37.890
The manager did that?

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:41.361
Come on, man.
You got to learn to delegate.

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:47.500
I don't think there's been
a single piece of good news

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.368
in tonight's monologue.

00:02:50.402 --> 00:02:52.237
And I know you were bummed out
by Grimace,

00:02:52.237 --> 00:02:54.307
but I got some good news.

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:57.243
People are pissing
in the Arby's machines.

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:03.416
According to the latest numbers,
the new 28-step staircase

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:05.251
that opened yesterday
at the Times Square

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.719
subway station cost $30 million.

00:03:07.719 --> 00:03:10.322
Well, at least they finally
addressed the complaint

00:03:10.322 --> 00:03:13.526
that no one had
about the subway.

00:03:14.526 --> 00:03:15.862
"I don't mind the delays.

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:19.199
I just wish
the steps were fancier.

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:24.704
I liked the rats.

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:28.341
I just want new steps."

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:35.248
And, finally, it was announced
yesterday that

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:37.850
"The Masked Singer" will return
for an eighth season,

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.486
because they need somewhere
to put all the people

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:42.722
too embarrassing for
"Dancing with the Stars."

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:45.592
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

